<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>
<div class="verify-page">
  <h1>회원가입을 위한 본인인증 단계입니다.</h1>
  <p class="verify-subtitle">원하시는 인증방법을 선택해주세요.</p>

  <div class="verify-method-list">
    <span class="verify-method-card disabled">
      <span class="verify-method-icon">🔒</span>
      <span>간편인증</span>
    </span>
    <div class="verify-method-row">
      <a class="verify-method-card" href="/signup/verify/phone">
        <span class="verify-method-icon">📱</span>
        <span>휴대폰 인증</span>
      </a>
      <span class="verify-method-card disabled">
        <span class="verify-method-icon">🛡️</span>
        <span>아이핀 인증</span>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="verify-notice">
    <li>본인인증에 입력한 정보는 인증 확인 용도로만 사용되며 별도로 저장되지 않습니다.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
